## 🚀 Getting Started

This is a single-file React component. Drop it into any React project or run it with a tool like [Vite](https://vitejs.dev/).

### With Vite

```bash
npm create vite@latest swing-trader -- --template react
cd swing-trader
npm install
```

Replace `src/App.jsx` with the contents of `trader-checklist.jsx`, then:

```bash
npm run dev
```

### With Claude Artifacts

Paste the file contents directly into a Claude React artifact — it runs immediately with no setup.

