## 🧠 The Philosophy

> You don't have a trading problem. You have a trust problem — you don't trust the plan you made with a calm mind.

This tool is built around one idea: **your pre-trade self is a better analyst than your in-trade self.** The checklist, the panic timer, and the mood check all exist to protect your plan from your emotions.

Rules that matter most:
- Set your stop and target **before** you enter, not after
- Fear alone is **not** a valid reason to close early
- Rate your discipline separately from your P&L — a losing trade with 10/10 discipline is a success
- Never trade to recover a loss

